WEBVTT

00:10:56.847 --> 00:11:00.549
The heart cracks under sad gazes,

00:11:00.554 --> 00:11:04.327
rides on storms that spread fire,

00:11:04.327 --> 00:11:07.451
lifts chests lowered by shame,

00:11:07.451 --> 00:11:10.627
knows that it's not just reading
and going on,

00:11:10.627 --> 00:11:14.452
it also wishes to see the infinite blue.

00:11:14.457 --> 00:11:18.185
The heart sits down to think about things,

00:11:18.185 --> 00:11:20.897
fights to avoid being ordinary,

00:11:20.897 --> 00:11:24.320
tries to love without hurting,

00:11:24.320 --> 00:11:28.023
breathes the sun,
giving courage to itself,

00:11:28.023 --> 00:11:32.391
surrenders, travels toward reason.